**Anserini reproductions from raw documents**

+ **Models**: [SPLADE++ CoCondenser-EnsembleDistil](https://arxiv.org/abs/2205.04733) (using ONNX for on-the-fly query encoding)
+ **Config**: [`${yaml_short}`](${yaml})
